      "alt": "tqmt1022 embedded board",
      "text": "<h1>Dual Core Power Architecture® module with high I/O connectivity and high computing power with low power consumption</h1>\r\n<p>The embedded module TQMT1022 together with the other pin compatible variants of the T-Series modules forms the next generation of the well-known NXP QorIQ® product family TQMP1020/2020. Based on the T-Series processors, new applications are opening up in industrial applications as well as in communication.</p>\r\n",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Thu Sep 17 2026 19:15:39 GMT+0000",
