     "table": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
      "text": "<table cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\">\r\n<tbody><tr><td><b>CPU</b></td>\r\n<td><p>CPU/Processor:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Dual T1022 Power Architecture® e5500 cores (64bit)</li>\r\n<li>CPU JTAG interface</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>Memory</b></td>\r\n<td><p>EEPROM:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>32kbit</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>eMMC:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to 8 GB (optional)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>NOR Flash:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to 256 MB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>DDR3L:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to 8 GB</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>Graphics</b></td>\r\n<td><p>Graphic interface:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Display controller for TFT LCD displays (up to 24-bit RGB)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>Communication interfaces</b></td>\r\n<td><p>Serial Ports:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>DUART, max. 115 kBaud (RS232)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Ethernet:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5x Gbit Ethernet (with IEEE® 1588v2)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>USB:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2x USB 2.0 High Speed Host/Device/OTG</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>Other interfaces</b></td>\r\n<td><p>SATA:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2x SATA 2.0</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>GPIO:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Up to 32x GPIO</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>SPI:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1x eSPI Controller</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>I2C:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4x I²C, max. 400 kHz</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>PCIe:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>4x PCle, 2.0 Controller up to 5.0 Gbit/s according to PCI Express specification 2.0 as Root-Complex or Endpoint</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>General</b></td>\r\n<td><p>Plug-in System:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Board-to-Board plug-in system 360 pins</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Power supply:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>5 V</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Power consumption:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>typ. 5 W up to 7 W</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Dimensions:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>74 mm x 54 mm</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Temperature range:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Standard temperature: 0°C - +70°C</li>\r\n<li>Extended temperature: -40°C - +85°C</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>General:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Simple expansion for example via MMC/SDHC, USB</li>\r\n<li>Real-Time Debug Interface (Aurora)</li>\r\n<li>1x Integrated Flash Controller (IFC), 16-bit</li>\r\n<li>2x TDM (via QUICC Engine)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr><tr><td><b>OS</b></td>\r\n<td><p>OS Support:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Linux</li>\r\n<li>PikeOS™ (on request)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table>\r\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Sep 16 2026 15:17:49 GMT+0000",
